leaves.doc:
Error model of one curve, sampled by the page:
x = (i/140)^1.25 · 100000 for i = 0…140;
e = 0.95·exp(−x/decay) + floor·(1 + 2.2·exp(−x/22000))·(1 + noise·(rnd − 0.5));
y = log10(min(e, 1)), plotted on 10⁰…10⁻⁴. `rnd` is the shared Park–Miller
generator seeded with `HomeChart.seed`, consumed series by series.
